# DigitalGuardian area 53, the second run for fn_14_A6A8: "XDEL" (0x5844454C) before the guardian's
# first Think, so both collision managers (0xE60, 0xE64) are null and no beacon sound plays. A
# delete request delivers "XDEL" (kSM_Delete) and then removes the guardian.
@f30 layer 3
@f60 layer 11
@f145 obj e00350060
@f150 send e00350060 Delete
@f170 objs Guardian
@f180 covdump
